## SOLUTION ##
I went ahead and structured the file with these name conventions:

### start of monitor section 'brand -- description..'
// PNP -- Legion5 Dual Monitor Layout

### each monitor entry 'brand -- virtual position'
// PNP -- LEFT
output "HDMI-A-1" {
    mode "1920x1080@60.00"
    position x=0 y=0
}

### end of monitor section for PNP brand
// PNP -- END SECTION

